cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its models, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Prewright: a language model that has never heard of human flight"
abstract: >-
  A small GPT trained only on PG-19 books published up to 1902, with all
  human-flight material removed, plus a matched control model trained on the
  same books with the flight material left in, and an evaluation that measures
  what the flight-free model does not know.
authors:
